B.aht=new A.jD("How do I pay?","In person, directly to the business, when the job is done or the order is handed over \u2014 cash or card, whatever the business accepts. LocalHive never collects card details in the app.")
B.ahr=new A.jD("What is the platform fee?","A flat 12% platform fee, always itemised at checkout before you confirm. The total you see at checkout is the total you pay \u2014 no surprises on handover.")
